<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Physician Support started.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Physician Support started.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Bear Stearns started Physician Support Systems Inc as attractive, a source at the brokerage said.</p>
<p>-- The stock was up 1/2 to 17-1/4 in early trading Tuesday.</p>
<p>-- Wall Street bureau, 212-859-1730</p>
</text>
